<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>ZAMAN — Modular Retro Console | Kawn Electro</title>
<meta name="description" content="ZAMAN: a modular, repairable retro gaming console for golden-age emulation up to the PS2 & GameCube era. By Kawn Electro, a Saudi independent hardware lab.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Chakra+Petch:wght@400;500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&family=Reem+Kufi:wght@500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --night:#0b1022;
  --night-2:#0e1530;
  --panel:#141b38;
  --panel-2:#1a2348;
  --ink:#edf0fb;
  --sub:#98a2c9;
  --faint:#5f6995;
  --sand:#e8b765;
  --sand-deep:#c9923c;
  --sand-soft:rgba(232,183,101,.13);
  --peri:#8ea6ff;
  --peri-soft:rgba(142,166,255,.14);
  --line:#263158;
  --line-soft:#1d2748;
  --display:'Chakra Petch',sans-serif;
  --body:'IBM Plex Sans',sans-serif;
  --mono:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;
  --arabic:'Reem Kufi',sans-serif;
  --ease:cubic-bezier(.22,.9,.3,1);
  --nav-h:68px;
}
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{
  font-family:var(--body);
  background:var(--night);
  color:var(--ink);
  line-height:1.65;
  overflow-x:hidden;
}
::selection{background:var(--sand);color:var(--night)}
img{max-width:100%;display:block}
a{color:inherit}

/* ───────── shared layout ───────── */
section{padding:7rem 1.5rem;position:relative}
.wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto}
.eyebrow{
  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.6rem;
  font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.22em;
  text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--sand);
  margin-bottom:1.1rem;
}
.eyebrow::before{content:'';width:8px;height:8px;background:var(--sand);box-shadow:0 0 12px var(--sand)}
h2{
  font-family:var(--display);font-weight:700;
  font-size:clamp(1.7rem,3.4vw,2.4rem);
  letter-spacing:.01em;line-height:1.15;
  margin-bottom:1.2rem;
}
.lede{color:var(--sub);max-width:60ch;font-size:1.05rem}

/* scroll reveal */
.reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px);transition:opacity .7s var(--ease),transform .7s var(--ease)}
.reveal.in{opacity:1;transform:none}

/* ───────── nav ───────── */
.navbar{
  position:fixed;inset:0 0 auto 0;height:var(--nav-h);z-index:100;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;
  padding:0 1.5rem;
  background:rgba(11,16,34,.85);
  backdrop-filter:blur(14px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px);
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-soft);
}
.nav-inner{width:100%;max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem}
.logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.65rem;text-decoration:none}
.logo img{height:36px;width:auto}
.logo span{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:600;font-size:.85rem;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink)}
.nav-links{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1.6rem;list-style:none}
.nav-links a{
  font-family:var(--display);font-size:.78rem;font-weight:500;
  letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none;
  color:var(--sub);padding:.35rem 0;position:relative;transition:color .25s;
}
.nav-links a::after{
  content:'';position:absolute;left:0;bottom:0;width:100%;height:2px;
  background:var(--sand);transform:scaleX(0);transform-origin:left;
  transition:transform .3s var(--ease);
}
.nav-links a:hover,.nav-links a.active{color:var(--ink)}
.nav-links a.active::after{transform:scaleX(1)}
.nav-cta{
  font-family:var(--display);font-size:.75rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.1em;
  text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none;
  color:var(--night);background:var(--sand);
  padding:.55rem 1.1rem;border-radius:3px;
  transition:background .25s,transform .25s;
  white-space:nowrap;
}
.nav-cta:hover{background:#f3c87d;transform:translateY(-1px)}
.hamburger{display:none;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;cursor:pointer;padding:.5rem;background:none;border:0}
.hamburger span{width:24px;height:2px;background:var(--ink);transition:transform .3s,opacity .3s}
.hamburger.open span:nth-child(1){transform:translateY(7px) rotate(45deg)}
.hamburger.open span:nth-child(2){opacity:0}
.hamburger.open span:nth-child(3){transform:translateY(-7px) rotate(-45deg)}

/* ───────── hero ───────── */
#home{
  min-height:100svh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  text-align:center;padding-top:calc(var(--nav-h) + 3rem);
  background:
    radial-gradient(1100px 600px at 50% -10%,rgba(142,166,255,.10),transparent 65%),
    radial-gradient(900px 500px at 50% 115%,rgba(232,183,101,.07),transparent 60%),
    var(--night);
  overflow:hidden;
}
.hero-zaman-ar{
  position:absolute;left:50%;top:46%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);
  font-family:var(--arabic);font-weight:700;
  font-size:clamp(16rem,42vw,34rem);line-height:1;
  color:transparent;
  -webkit-text-stroke:1px rgba(142,166,255,.13);
  user-select:none;pointer-events:none;z-index:0;
}
/* PS2-boot "time towers" */
.towers{position:absolute;inset:auto 0 0 0;height:38%;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:center;gap:2.2vw;z-index:0;pointer-events:none;
  -webkit-mask-image:linear-gradient(to top,rgba(0,0,0,.9),transparent);mask-image:linear-gradient(to top,rgba(0,0,0,.9),transparent)}
.towers i{
  display:block;width:clamp(14px,2.4vw,30px);
  background:linear-gradient(to top,rgba(142,166,255,.16),rgba(142,166,255,.02));
  border:1px solid rgba(142,166,255,.10);border-bottom:0;
  animation:tower-rise 9s var(--ease) infinite alternate;
}
.towers i:nth-child(1){height:34%;animation-delay:-1s}
.towers i:nth-child(2){height:62%;animation-delay:-3s}
.towers i:nth-child(3){height:45%;animation-delay:-5s}
.towers i:nth-child(4){height:78%;animation-delay:-2s}
.towers i:nth-child(5){height:52%;animation-delay:-6s}
.towers i:nth-child(6){height:68%;animation-delay:-4s}
.towers i:nth-child(7){height:40%;animation-delay:-7s}
.towers i:nth-child(8){height:58%;animation-delay:-1.5s}
@keyframes tower-rise{from{transform:scaleY(.92)}to{transform:scaleY(1.06)}}
.hero-inner{position:relative;z-index:1;max-width:820px;margin:0 auto}
.hero-logo{height:88px;width:auto;margin:0 auto 2rem;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 24px rgba(232,183,101,.35))}
.hero-title{
  font-family:var(--display);font-weight:700;
  font-size:clamp(3.2rem,9vw,6rem);
  letter-spacing:.14em;line-height:1;
  text-indent:.14em; /* visually re-centre tracked caps */
  margin-bottom:1.4rem;
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff 20%,var(--sand) 120%);
  -webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent;
}
.hero-tag{
  font-family:var(--display);font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(.95rem,2vw,1.2rem);
  letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:.6rem;
}
.hero-tag em{font-style:normal;color:var(--peri)}
.hero-sub{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.8rem;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--faint);margin-bottom:2.6rem}
.btn{
  display:inline-block;font-family:var(--display);font-weight:600;
  font-size:.85rem;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none;
  color:var(--night);background:var(--sand);
  padding:.95rem 2.2rem;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid var(--sand);
  box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(232,183,101,.4);
  transition:transform .25s var(--ease),box-shadow .25s,background .25s;
}
.btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(232,183,101,.25);background:#f3c87d}
.btn-ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--sand)}
.btn-ghost:hover{background:var(--sand-soft);box-shadow:none}
.hero-meta{
  margin-top:3.2rem;display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:2.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap;
  font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--faint);
}
.hero-meta b{display:block;font-weight:500;color:var(--sub);font-size:.8rem;margin-top:.2rem}

/* ───────── why ───────── */
#why-zaman{background:var(--night-2);border-block:1px solid var(--line-soft)}
.why-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1.2rem;margin-top:2.5rem}
.why-card{
  background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;
  padding:1.9rem 1.6rem;
  transition:transform .3s var(--ease),border-color .3s;
}
.why-card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);border-color:var(--sand-deep)}
.why-card .k{
  font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.18em;color:var(--peri);
  display:block;margin-bottom:1rem;
}
.why-card h3{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:600;font-size:1.05rem;letter-spacing:.04em;margin-bottom:.7rem}
.why-card p{color:var(--sub);font-size:.95rem}

/* ───────── project / mode toggle ───────── */
.mode-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:2rem;flex-wrap:wrap}
.mode-switch{
  display:inline-flex;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:5px;overflow:hidden;
  background:var(--panel);
}
.mode-switch button{
  font-family:var(--display);font-weight:600;font-size:.78rem;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--sub);background:transparent;border:0;padding:.7rem 1.5rem;cursor:pointer;
  transition:color .25s,background .25s;
}
.mode-switch button[aria-pressed="true"]{background:var(--sand);color:var(--night)}
.rig{
  margin-top:2.6rem;position:relative;
  background:
    radial-gradient(600px 300px at 50% 50%,rgba(142,166,255,.06),transparent 70%),
    var(--night-2);
  border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;
  height:340px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  overflow:hidden;
}
.rig-grid{position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:
  linear-gradient(rgba(142,166,255,.05) 1px,transparent 1px),
  linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(142,166,255,.05) 1px,transparent 1px);
  background-size:36px 36px;pointer-events:none}
.device{position:absolute;top:50%;transition:opacity .55s var(--ease),transform .55s var(--ease)}
/* wing: handheld */
.wing{
  left:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);
  width:min(420px,72vw);height:170px;border-radius:18px;
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--panel-2),var(--panel));
  border:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:0 18px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.45);
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:0 1.1rem;
}
.wing .screen{
  width:55%;height:72%;border-radius:8px;
  background:radial-gradient(120% 120% at 30% 20%,#23306b,#101737);
  border:1px solid #2c3a72;position:relative;overflow:hidden;
}
.wing .screen::after{
  content:'زمن';font-family:var(--arabic);font-weight:700;color:rgba(232,183,101,.8);
  position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  font-size:2rem;text-shadow:0 0 18px rgba(232,183,101,.5);
}
.pad{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:10px}
.stick{width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;background:#0c1228;border:2px solid var(--line)}
.dpad,.face{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,8px);grid-template-rows:repeat(3,8px);gap:2px}
.dpad i:nth-child(2),.dpad i:nth-child(4),.dpad i:nth-child(6),.dpad i:nth-child(8){background:#39497f;border-radius:2px}
.face i:nth-child(2),.face i:nth-child(4),.face i:nth-child(6),.face i:nth-child(8){background:var(--sand-deep);border-radius:50%}
/* nest: dock */
.nest{
  left:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%) scale(.92);opacity:0;
  width:min(300px,60vw);height:190px;
}
.nest .tower{
  position:absolute;inset:auto 0 0 0;height:120px;border-radius:10px;
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--panel-2),#10162f);
  border:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:0 18px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.45);
}
.nest .tower::before{ /* vent slits */
  content:'';position:absolute;left:18px;right:18px;bottom:16px;height:34px;
  background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,#222d5c 0 4px,transparent 4px 10px);
  border-radius:3px;opacity:.7;
}
.nest .tower::after{ /* status LED */
  content:'';position:absolute;right:16px;top:14px;width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;
  background:var(--peri);box-shadow:0 0 10px var(--peri);
}
.nest .slot{
  position:absolute;top:38px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);
  width:130px;height:14px;border-radius:4px 4px 0 0;
  background:#0a0f24;border:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:0;
}
/* core cartridge */
.core{
  position:absolute;z-index:3;width:96px;height:58px;border-radius:7px;
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,#2a356b,#1b2450);
  border:1px solid #3b4a8c;
  box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(142,166,255,.15),0 10px 28px rgba(0,0,0,.5),0 0 22px rgba(142,166,255,.18);
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.6rem;letter-spacing:.22em;color:var(--peri);
  top:50%;left:50%;
  transform:translate(-50%,-50%) translate(0,-6px);
  transition:transform .8s var(--ease);
}
.core::after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:auto 14px 6px 14px;height:5px;border-radius:2px;
  background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,var(--sand-deep) 0 5px,transparent 5px 9px);opacity:.85}
/* docked state */
.rig[data-mode="docked"] .wing{opacity:0;transform:translate(-50%,-50%) scale(.94)}
.rig[data-mode="docked"] .nest{opacity:1;transform:translate(-50%,-50%) scale(1)}
.rig[data-mode="docked"] .core{transform:translate(-50%,-50%) translate(0,-34px)}
.rig-caption{
  margin-top:1rem;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.74rem;letter-spacing:.1em;
  color:var(--faint);text-align:center;min-height:1.4em;
}
.rig-caption b{color:var(--sub);font-weight:500}

/* component cards */
.comp-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1.2rem;margin-top:3.5rem}
.comp-card{
  background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;
  transition:transform .3s var(--ease),border-color .3s;
}
.comp-card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);border-color:var(--peri)}
.comp-card img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover;background:var(--night-2);cursor:zoom-in}
.comp-card .body{padding:1.3rem 1.4rem 1.5rem}
.comp-card h3{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:600;font-size:1rem;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:.5rem;color:var(--sand)}
.comp-card p{color:var(--sub);font-size:.92rem}
.core-detail{margin-top:3.5rem}
.core-detail h3{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:600;font-size:1rem;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--sub);margin-bottom:1.2rem}
.core-images{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1.2rem}
.core-images img{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;background:var(--night-2);cursor:zoom-in}

/* ───────── specs ───────── */
#specs{background:var(--night-2);border-block:1px solid var(--line-soft)}
.specs-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1.2rem;margin-top:2.5rem}
.spec-card{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden}
.spec-card.wide{grid-column:1 / -1}
.spec-card header{
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;
  padding:.9rem 1.3rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--panel-2),var(--panel));
}
.spec-card header h3{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:600;font-size:.95rem;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase}
.spec-card header .tag{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.65rem;letter-spacing:.18em;color:var(--peri)}
.spec-row{
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:130px 1fr;gap:1rem;
  padding:.85rem 1.3rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-soft);
}
.spec-row:last-child{border-bottom:0}
.spec-row dt{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--faint);padding-top:.15rem}
.spec-row dd{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.84rem;color:var(--ink)}
.io-list{list-style:none;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(170px,1fr));gap:.35rem .9rem}
.io-list li{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.8rem;color:var(--ink)}
.io-list li::before{content:'▸ ';color:var(--sand)}
.spec-note{margin-top:1.4rem;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--faint)}

/* ───────── progress ───────── */
.gallery{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1.2rem;margin-top:2.5rem}
.gallery img{
  width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover;border-radius:6px;
  border:1px solid var(--line);cursor:zoom-in;background:var(--night-2);
  transition:transform .3s var(--ease),border-color .3s;
}
.gallery img:hover{transform:scale(1.015);border-color:var(--sand-deep)}

/* ───────── about / founder ───────── */
#about{background:var(--night-2);border-block:1px solid var(--line-soft)}
.about-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.5fr 1fr;gap:3rem;align-items:start}
.about-grid p{color:var(--sub);margin-bottom:1.1rem}
.quote{
  border-left:3px solid var(--sand);background:var(--sand-soft);
  padding:1.2rem 1.4rem;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0;
  font-family:var(--display);font-weight:500;font-size:1.05rem;color:var(--ink);
  margin-bottom:1.6rem;
}
.about-logo{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;padding:2rem;display:flex;justify-content:center}
.about-logo img{max-height:130px;width:auto}
.founder-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:280px 1fr;gap:3rem;align-items:center}
.founder-photo img{
  width:100%;aspect-ratio:1;object-fit:cover;border-radius:6px;
  border:1px solid var(--line);
}
.founder-grid p{color:var(--sub);margin-bottom:1.1rem}
.cred{
  display:inline-block;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em;
  text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--peri);border:1px solid var(--line);
  padding:.35rem .8rem;border-radius:3px;margin-top:.4rem;
}

/* ───────── contact ───────── */
#contact{text-align:center;background:
  radial-gradient(700px 360px at 50% 110%,rgba(232,183,101,.08),transparent 65%),var(--night)}
.email-link{
  font-family:var(--mono);font-size:clamp(.85rem,2.4vw,1.05rem);color:var(--sand);
  text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid var(--sand-deep);padding-bottom:2px;
  transition:color .25s;word-break:break-all;
}
.email-link:hover{color:#f3c87d}
.loc{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.75rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--faint);margin-top:1rem}
.contact-cta{margin-top:2.8rem}
.contact-cta p{font-size:.9rem;color:var(--sub);margin-top:.9rem}

/* ───────── footer ───────── */
.site-footer{
  border-top:1px solid var(--line-soft);padding:2.6rem 1.5rem;text-align:center;
}
.social-links{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:1.2rem;margin-bottom:1.4rem}
.social-links a{
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:42px;height:42px;
  border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:5px;transition:border-color .25s,transform .25s;
}
.social-links a:hover{border-color:var(--sand);transform:translateY(-2px)}
.social-links svg{width:18px;height:18px;fill:var(--sub)}
.social-links a:hover svg{fill:var(--sand)}
.copyright{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.74rem;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--faint)}
.fineprint{font-size:.72rem;color:var(--faint);margin-top:.5rem}

/* ───────── lightbox ───────── */
.lightbox{
  position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(7,10,22,.92);z-index:200;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:2rem;
  opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .3s;cursor:zoom-out;
}
.lightbox.open{opacity:1;pointer-events:auto}
.lightbox img{max-width:92vw;max-height:88vh;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid var(--line)}

/* ───────── responsive ───────── */
@media (max-width:900px){
  .why-grid,.comp-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
  .specs-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .about-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .founder-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:2rem}
  .founder-photo{max-width:280px}
}
@media (max-width:680px){
  section{padding:5rem 1.25rem}
  .nav-links{
    position:fixed;top:var(--nav-h);right:0;width:min(280px,80vw);
    height:calc(100vh - var(--nav-h));flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;
    gap:.4rem;padding:1.6rem;background:var(--night-2);
    border-left:1px solid var(--line);
    transform:translateX(100%);transition:transform .35s var(--ease);
  }
  .nav-links.open{transform:none}
  .nav-links a{font-size:.9rem;padding:.6rem 0;display:block;width:100%}
  .hamburger{display:flex}
  .nav-cta{display:none}
  .why-grid,.comp-grid,.core-images,.gallery{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .spec-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:.2rem}
  .rig{height:300px}
  .hero-zaman-ar{font-size:18rem}
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  *,*::before,*::after{animation:none!important;transition:none!important;scroll-behavior:auto!important}
  .reveal{opacity:1;transform:none}
}
:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--sand);outline-offset:3px}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ============ NAV ============ -->
<nav class="navbar">
  <div class="nav-inner">
    <a href="#home" class="logo">
      <img src="images/Zaman_Logo.png" alt="Zaman logo">
      <span>Kawn Electro</span>
    </a>
    <ul class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
      <li><a href="#home" data-section="home" class="active">Home</a></li>
      <li><a href="#why-zaman" data-section="why-zaman">Why Zaman</a></li>
      <li><a href="#project" data-section="project">Project</a></li>
      <li><a href="#specs" data-section="specs">Specs</a></li>
      <li><a href="#about" data-section="about">About</a></li>
      <li><a href="#founder" data-section="founder">Founder</a></li>
      <li><a href="#contact" data-section="contact">Contact</a></li>
    </ul>
    <a class="nav-cta" href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSc5cWbgayor35DVEBR7uxhy4HpG3ON7OKLDusDju3SYBmw71Q/viewform?usp=header" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Join the waitlist</a>
    <button class="hamburger" id="hamburger" aria-label="Open menu" aria-expanded="false">
      <span></span><span></span><span></span>
    </button>
  </div>
</nav>

<!-- ============ HERO ============ -->
<section id="home">
  <span class="hero-zaman-ar" aria-hidden="true">زمن</span>
  <div class="towers" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
  <div class="hero-inner reveal in">
    <img src="images/Zaman_Hero.png" alt="" class="hero-logo" onerror="this.style.display='none'">
    <h1 class="hero-title">ZAMAN</h1>
    <p class="hero-tag">Golden-age retro emulation — up to the <em>PS2 &amp; GameCube</em> era</p>
    <p class="hero-sub">By Kawn Electro · Saudi independent hardware engineering lab</p>
    <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSc5cWbgayor35DVEBR7uxhy4HpG3ON7OKLDusDju3SYBmw71Q/viewform?usp=header" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn">Join the waitlist</a>
    <div class="hero-meta">
      <div>Modules<b>Core · Wing · Nest</b></div>
      <div>Philosophy<b>Modular &amp; repairable</b></div>
      <div>Arriving<b>End of 2026</b></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ WHY ============ -->
<section id="why-zaman">
  <div class="wrap reveal">
    <span class="eyebrow">Why Zaman</span>
    <h2>A console built to outlast its generation</h2>
    <p class="lede">"Zaman" means <em>time</em> in Arabic — and time is exactly what this hardware is designed to survive.</p>
    <div class="why-grid">
      <div class="why-card">
        <span class="k">01 · UPGRADE, DON'T REPLACE</span>
        <h3>Economic modularity</h3>
        <p>Why buy an entire new device every generation? Keep the high-quality screen, controller (Wing) and dock (Nest) you already own — and upgrade just the Core.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-card">
        <span class="k">02 · BOOT INTO PLAY</span>
        <h3>Meaningful fun</h3>
        <p>A dedicated device that respects your time instead of hijacking it. No feeds, no doomscrolling — a tailored OS boots straight into your games in seconds.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-card">
        <span class="k">03 · YOURS TO TINKER</span>
        <h3>Open ecosystem</h3>
        <p>Zaman fully embraces open-source operating systems and emulation frontends. Tweak and tune your ultimate retro experience, free of corporate software restrictions.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ PROJECT ============ -->
<section id="project">
  <div class="wrap reveal">
    <div class="mode-head">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">The Project</span>
        <h2>One Core. Two bodies.</h2>
        <p class="lede">Zaman is a hybrid console designed for longevity, repairability, and cost-effective upgrades — a swappable Core that slides between a handheld Wing and a desktop Nest.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mode-switch" role="group" aria-label="Play mode">
        <button type="button" id="modeHandheld" aria-pressed="true">Handheld</button>
        <button type="button" id="modeDocked" aria-pressed="false">Docked</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="rig" id="rig" data-mode="handheld" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="rig-grid"></div>
      <div class="device wing">
        <div class="pad"><div class="stick"></div><div class="dpad"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div>
        <div class="screen"></div>
        <div class="pad"><div class="face"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="stick"></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="device nest">
        <div class="slot"></div>
        <div class="tower"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="core">CORE</div>
    </div>
    <p class="rig-caption" id="rigCaption"><b>Handheld:</b> the Core powers the Wing — a 6&Prime; 120 Hz OLED handheld.</p>

    <div class="comp-grid">
      <article class="comp-card">
        <img src="images/Zaman_Core_Top.png" alt="Zaman Core module" data-zoom>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Core</h3>
          <p>The swappable brain — efficient processor, RAM, storage and wireless. Upgradable across generations.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="comp-card">
        <img src="images/Zaman_Wing.png" alt="Zaman Wing handheld module" data-zoom>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Wing</h3>
          <p>The handheld body — high-refresh 6&Prime; display, large battery, and hall-effect controls.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="comp-card">
        <img src="images/Zaman_Nest.png" alt="Zaman Nest docking module" data-zoom>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Nest</h3>
          <p>The desktop body — a docking station with full connectivity and advanced cooling that unlocks the processor's full performance.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="core-detail">
      <h3>Core module — top &amp; bottom</h3>
      <div class="core-images">
        <img src="images/Zaman_Core_Top.png" alt="Core module, top view" data-zoom>
        <img src="images/Zaman_Core_Bottom.png" alt="Core module, bottom view" data-zoom>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ SPECS ============ -->
<section id="specs">
  <div class="wrap reveal">
    <span class="eyebrow">System Data</span>
    <h2>Preliminary specs</h2>
    <div class="specs-grid">

      <div class="spec-card">
        <header><h3>Zaman Core</h3><span class="tag">MODULE 01</span></header>
        <dl>
          <div class="spec-row"><dt>Processor</dt><dd>Rockchip RK3588S — 8-core 64-bit ARM CPU, up to 2.4 GHz</dd></div>
          <div class="spec-row"><dt>Graphics</dt><dd>ARM Mali-G610 built-in 3D GPU</dd></div>
          <div class="spec-row"><dt>Memory</dt><dd>8 GB – 16 GB fast LPDDR4x / LPDDR5</dd></div>
          <div class="spec-row"><dt>Storage</dt><dd>128 GB – 256 GB M.2 PCIe NVMe SSD</dd></div>
          <div class="spec-row"><dt>Cooling</dt><dd>Solid-state active cooling — whisper-quiet, sub-20 dBA</dd></div>
          <div class="spec-row"><dt>Wireless</dt><dd>Wi-Fi 6E + Bluetooth</dd></div>
          <div class="spec-row"><dt>Connector</dt><dd>Durable high-speed interface at PCIe Gen 4 speeds — future-proofed</dd></div>
        </dl>
      </div>

      <div class="spec-card">
        <header><h3>Zaman Wing</h3><span class="tag">MODULE 02</span></header>
        <dl>
          <div class="spec-row"><dt>Display</dt><dd>6&Prime; OLED, 120 Hz</dd></div>
          <div class="spec-row"><dt>Battery</dt><dd>6000 mAh</dd></div>
          <div class="spec-row"><dt>Controls</dt><dd>Hall-effect thumbsticks (zero stick drift), quiet face buttons, HD haptics</dd></div>
          <div class="spec-row"><dt>Ergonomics</dt><dd>Adult-sized grips for hours of comfortable, cramp-free play</dd></div>
        </dl>
      </div>

      <div class="spec-card wide">
        <header><h3>Zaman Nest</h3><span class="tag">MODULE 03</span></header>
        <dl>
          <div class="spec-row"><dt>Cooling</dt><dd>Additional cooling that unlocks the processor's full TDP</dd></div>
          <div class="spec-row">
            <dt>I/O</dt>
            <dd>
              <ul class="io-list">
                <li>1× USB-C (full-featured)</li>
                <li>2× USB 3.0 Type-A</li>
                <li>2× USB 2.0 Type-A</li>
                <li>1× HDMI</li>
                <li>1× DisplayPort</li>
                <li>1× 1 Gbit Ethernet</li>
                <li>1× 3.5 mm AUX</li>
                <li>1× extra M.2 SSD slot</li>
              </ul>
            </dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </div>

    </div>
    <p class="spec-note">// Specifications are preliminary and subject to change before launch.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ PROGRESS ============ -->
<section id="progress">
  <div class="wrap reveal">
    <span class="eyebrow">In the Lab</span>
    <h2>Stay tuned</h2>
    <p class="lede">Real prototyping, real progress — follow along as Zaman comes to life.</p>
    <div class="gallery">
      <img src="images/Zaman_Progress1.jpg" alt="Zaman prototype progress photo 1" data-zoom>
      <img src="images/Zaman_Progress2.jpg" alt="Zaman prototype progress photo 2" data-zoom>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ ABOUT ============ -->
<section id="about">
  <div class="wrap reveal">
    <span class="eyebrow">The Lab</span>
    <h2>About Kawn Electro</h2>
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div>
        <p>Kawn Electro is a solo engineering lab dedicated to modular, repairable, and long-lasting hardware. Every design decision prioritises longevity and interoperability — rejecting planned obsolescence in favour of devices that users can upgrade, repair, and reconfigure over time.</p>
        <p>Based in Saudi Arabia, the lab is committed to open-ecosystem design principles. Whether developing consumer electronics or smart home devices, the goal remains the same: hardware that respects its owner's intelligence and investment.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="quote">Modularity is not a feature — it's a philosophy.</div>
        <div class="about-logo">
          <img src="images/Kawn_Electro_Logo.png" alt="Kawn Electro logo">
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ FOUNDER ============ -->
<section id="founder">
  <div class="wrap reveal">
    <div class="founder-grid">
      <div class="founder-photo">
        <img src="images/founder.jpeg" alt="Kadhem, founder of Kawn Electro">
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">The Founder</span>
        <h2>Kadhem</h2>
        <p>A hardware engineer and tech enthusiast with a passion for modular, repair-friendly electronics. His work spans embedded systems, smart home gadgets, and industrial devices — always driven by the belief that great hardware should grow with its user, not be replaced.</p>
        <p>With a hands-on approach to prototyping, Kadhem brings both professional experience and maker creativity to every project at Kawn Electro.</p>
        <span class="cred">CPCD · Certified PCB Designer (PCEA)</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ CONTACT ============ -->
<section id="contact">
  <div class="wrap reveal">
    <span class="eyebrow" style="justify-content:center">Get in Touch</span>
    <h2>Help shape the future of Zaman</h2>
    <p><a class="email-link" href="mailto:kadhem.alabdulmuhsin@kawnelectro.com">kadhem.alabdulmuhsin@kawnelectro.com</a></p>
    <p class="loc">Based in Saudi Arabia</p>
    <div class="contact-cta">
      <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSc5cWbgayor35DVEBR7uxhy4HpG3ON7OKLDusDju3SYBmw71Q/viewform?usp=header" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn">Join the waitlist</a>
      <p>Be first in line — and tell us what your ultimate retro console looks like.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ FOOTER ============ -->
<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="social-links">
    <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/kadhem-alabdulmuhsin-cpcd-a644959a/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="LinkedIn">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20.447 20.452h-3.554v-5.569c0-1.328-.027-3.037-1.852-3.037-1.853 0-2.136 1.445-2.136 2.939v5.667H9.351V9h3.414v1.561h.046c.477-.9 1.637-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.601 0 4.267 2.37 4.267 5.455v6.286zM5.337 7.433a2.062 2.062 0 01-2.063-2.065 2.064 2.064 0 112.063 2.065zm1.782 13.019H3.555V9h3.564v11.452zM22.225 0H1.771C.792 0 0 .774 0 1.729v20.542C0 23.227.792 24 1.771 24h20.451C23.2 24 24 23.227 24 22.271V1.729C24 .774 23.2 0 22.222 0h.003z"/></svg>
